"Semeryss of Leki, Arcane Advisor to the Empire, was the ritual master who caused the cataclysm."
"The cataclysm ritual succeeded: it forged the Master Core, a sphere of every hue of mana."
"The Master Core answers only imperial authority, proven by the Reforged Crown of Harrak."
"Semeryss lived three centuries cursed by Nyil, as a flesh cocoon in the ritual chamber."
"Semeryss commanded the capital's necrarchs and built the dragon golem that led the great horde."
